":"1.0.0","category":"props","assetKind":"prop","theme":"nature","style":"soft-low-poly","title":"Soft Woodland Mushroom Clusters","description":"Original three clusters containing nine faceted mushrooms, with tapered grounded stems, warm caps and distinct cream undersides. Separate editable source parts; no external textures.","bounds":{"x":0.95205,"y":0.69263,"z":0.36875,"unit":"m"},"triangles":1260,"materials":2,"files":{"glb":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-mushroom-clusters-01/v1.0.0/model.glb","size":92684,"sha256":"c9abbdbf2f654ee0d7bf04ea8a84e210ff69f2a25602d62fb93a1ea19c808a43"},"blend":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-mushroom-clusters-01/v1.0.0/source.blend","size":646480,"sha256":"4c1c0b70e42c7563721158b66d2f5a93083eb84246dc00540652bb14a5b72446"},"generator":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-mushroom-clusters-01/v1.0.0/generate.py","size":28475,"sha256":"02318f8921e4e94036ede3b0346b135d999e131c90b55487d27f07b1c714865b"},"render":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-mushroom-clusters-01/v1.0.0/thumbnail.png","size":289946,"sha256":"d9a44ccef941f3f796859c693cc90e5eb2724769b04c379e9574eac714728f1a"}},"status":"verified","license":"All rights reserved","sourceId":"nature-extension"}],[129,{"id":"nature-shallow-stream-01","version":"1.0.0","category":"scenes","assetKind":"scene","theme":"nature","style":"soft-low-poly","title":"Soft Woodland Shallow Stream","description":"Original shallow stream woodland scene using four matched rocky bank modules, three mushroom clusters and two conifer saplings. Runtime GLB keeps GroundAndNature and WaterSurface_Runtime as separate named meshes for independent material replacement. Bank modules repeat every 2 m along X; water top is Z=0.16 m with 0.07 m thickness.","bounds":{"x":4.04,"y":3.04,"z":1.76489,"unit":"m"},"triangles":2652,"materials":8,"files":{"glb":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-shallow-stream-01/v1.0.0/model.glb","size":222628,"sha256":"06c40215de1cbabaa3e3f2b551844244f496a032d4ae74a8c9cc0ef654afb911"},"blend":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-shallow-stream-01/v1.0.0/source.blend","size":1131840,"sha256":"32ed856ba66268d7a0853aa0c1cde6c8940f6e9b5deb41126bb8a36e06d834bc"},"generator":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-shallow-stream-01/v1.0.0/generate.py","size":32980,"sha256":"3ad149e5c5f3a64e183a7d3f359ebf9e6c6cc6261155e292cd34b533f2772600"},"render":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-shallow-stream-01/v1.0.0/thumbnail.png","size":318582,"sha256":"c526f8fda8e943c01b1f9604b93fb8dc64dcad47722002d4d2922dffd65a6033"}},"status":"verified","license":"All rights reserved","sourceId":"nature-extension"}],[130,{"id":"nature-stream-bank-01","version":"1.0.0","category":"props","assetKind":"modular","theme":"nature","style":"soft-low-poly","title":"Soft Woodland Stream Bank Module","description":"Original rocky stream-bank module with a fixed 2 meter X repeat interval. Stream-facing edge is local Y=0 at Z=.06m; landward edge is Y=1.2m at Z=.55m. End profiles match exactly at X=-1 and +1; rocks stay clear of both interfaces.","bounds":{"x":2,"y":1.2,"z":0.73,"unit":"m"},"triangles":262,"materials":2,"files":{"glb":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-stream-bank-01/v1.0.0/model.glb","size":28004,"sha256":"e091b53a61af8c2c6f25cb447f94c31f77fcff1c2952d91c36e09bfd93452d2b"},"blend":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-stream-bank-01/v1.0.0/source.blend","size":548476,"sha256":"b93a51d4fe7c899814e290e7d36c78535d3e14538a9d1c479f67709a459a33dc"},"generator":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-stream-bank-01/v1.0.0/generate.py","size":28583,"sha256":"f09e50df4ff1694063e281f698decf601e41317075b9642b97a2739a2084031b"},"render":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-stream-bank-01/v1.0.0/thumbnail.png","size":295256,"sha256":"e690b6f2dcae5630c5db0a905a96698b07e5990253dc81635ea706f79e5e3bf7"}},"status":"verified","license":"All rights reserved","sourceId":"nature-extension"}],[131,{"id":"nature-stream-bend-01","version":"1.0.0","category":"props","assetKind":"modular","theme":"nature","style":"soft-low-poly","title":"Rocky Stream Corner","description":"Original 90-degree shallow-stream corner. Centerline radius 2 m; pivot (-1.75,-1.75)m; centerline ports (0.25,-1.75)m and (-1.75,0.25)m, tangent axes Y and X. Bank cross-sections match the 2m-repeat straight bank with a +0.09m height offset for the integrated base. GroundAndNature and WaterSurface_Runtime are separate GLB nodes; water top Z=0.16m.","bounds":{"x":3.54,"y":3.54,"z":0.72,"unit":"m"},"triangles":720,"materials":3,"files":{"glb":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-stream-bend-01/v1.0.0/model.glb","size":62080,"sha256":"b112254a4606d98736f5938c38ee9af58796fdf30f1f62a48d149cf7c9b72830"},"blend":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-stream-bend-01/v1.0.0/source.blend","size":640004,"sha256":"7c333f915ea7f5f741620c737ae09982b1c829e8bf4b66365a7618c5eb7dee08"},"generator":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-stream-bend-01/v1.0.0/generate.py","size":30509,"sha256":"4873b8012657887d8c0e9cd077eebc929d8e6f212f231e85de4b44de84b64a42"},"render":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-stream-bend-01/v1.0.0/thumbnail.png","size":306352,"sha256":"4d5b0ed9b6503f876b169d259301a64694fee11d79d89dea190a3bac70c429ad"}},"status":"verified","license":"All rights reserved","sourceId":"nature-extension"}],[132,{"id":"nature-umbrella-broadleaf-01","version":"1.0.0","category":"props","assetKind":"prop","theme":"nature","style":"hard-edge-faceted-nature","title":"Directional Umbrella Broadleaf Tree","description":"Hard-edge faceted broadleaf tree (style plan S02) with intentionally directional, asymmetric umbrella crown; three unequal main branches taper into a connected canopy. Solid untextured materials use coherent upper, side and underside value groups. Runtime visual tree, no wind rig; repeated concept instances are not additional tree variants.","bounds":{"x":4.56127,"y":2.47571,"z":5.00756,"unit":"m"},"triangles":546,"materials":5,"files":{"glb":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-umbrella-broadleaf-01/v1.0.0/model.glb","size":44960,"sha256":"b4a4da1937b6de09803959eb60a3a177ec9ed7075ef96feec153c4fd3560f55c