-companion-scree-01","version":"1.0.0","category":"props","assetKind":"prop","theme":"nature","style":"hard-edge-faceted-nature","title":"Companion Scree Cluster","description":"Hard-edge faceted S02 low scree grouping with a broad fracture slab and two unequal angular chips, each independently grounded. Designed as 0.34 m high path-edge or outcrop-transition dressing; not a scaled copy of the main outcrop. Coherent stone top, side and underside values. No collision mesh or physics rig.","bounds":{"x":1.19,"y":0.93,"z":0.34,"unit":"m"},"triangles":52,"materials":3,"files":{"glb":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-companion-scree-01/v1.0.0/model.glb","size":6324,"sha256":"f895aa4e05950a884c9380cb7e2410c9064a06edbc9e76d2b8f134320534905f"},"blend":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-companion-scree-01/v1.0.0/source.blend","size":574324,"sha256":"0617f7e2546b1e5d57d523fdd1d65793aecf2526709708cc8e92b76eec4ff647"},"generator":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-companion-scree-01/v1.0.0/generate.py","size":35433,"sha256":"a2cf8f6c45a20d0cbe555a04f3093c6c5ccf7967ca5877906f8b44a237b6b12d"},"render":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-companion-scree-01/v1.0.0/thumbnail.png","size":277037,"sha256":"0e773da1b44509a8c568e97c13d63852af853c37509f2fc9748740bd70c15cd9"}},"status":"verified","license":"All rights reserved","sourceId":"nature-core"}],[135,{"id":"nature-multistem-shrub-01","version":"1.0.0","category":"props","assetKind":"prop","theme":"nature","style":"hard-edge-faceted-nature","title":"Multi-stem Understory Shrub","description":"Hard-edge faceted S02 understory shrub with three independently grounded low stems, a continuous asymmetric broad crown and shallow frontal notch. Limited olive values follow coherent face orientation. Simplified supporting vegetation, 1.218 m high; no leaf or wind rig.","bounds":{"x":1.7,"y":0.97,"z":1.21776,"unit":"m"},"triangles":296,"materials":5,"files":{"glb":{"path":"assets/nature/nature-multistem-shrub-01/v1.0.0/model.glb","size":25068,"sha256":"874db44df